// Program 2: Add a string and a number.

print "Age: " + 20;

// Expected:
// I thought Lox might automatically convert 20 into the string "20"
// and print "Age: 20", similar to JavaScript.

// Actual:
// Lox gives a runtime error.

// Why:
// Lox does not automatically convert between numbers and strings.
// The + operator requires either two numbers or two strings.